# Cloudflare Pages response headers. Applied at the edge to every response
# served from the publish root (the main SPA on orangerails.com, the connect
# flow on connect.orangerails.com, and the docs.* host).
#
# Scope note: this file sets framing and content hardening headers only. It does
# NOT set a script/style/frame Content-Security-Policy. A restrictive script-src
# needs a full inventory of every origin the app talks to (Supabase, Quiltt, the
# stealth block source, analytics) plus QA, or it silently breaks the SPA. That
# is deliberately left as a separate follow up.

/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin

# --- connect.orangerails.com: the Stealth Sync widget host (OR-T0609) ---
# This host runs the client-side Bitcoin math (BIP157/158 filter matching via
# WebAssembly) and holds a customer's per-app vault key in memory (see
# docs/Stealth-Sync.md). It is the single most sensitive page in the product,
# so it gets a page-sized CSP instead of the template default-src 'self'.
#
# Scoped to this host only, via the same absolute-URL source-pattern
# mechanism the docs.orangerails.com rule above already uses, so this cannot
# silently break orangerails.com or docs.orangerails.com, which load things
# this page does not (e.g. Quiltt for bank-linking on the main app).
#
# Every origin below was found by reading the source on dev HEAD
# 2026-09-04, not assumed:
#   script-src 'wasm-unsafe-eval' -- src/stealth/lib/wasm/index.ts loads a
#     Vite-bundled same-origin .wasm chunk and calls WebAssembly.instantiate.
#     This is the narrow CSP3 keyword for that; it does not enable eval().
#   script-src sha256 hashes x4 -- the four fixed inline <script> blocks
#     index.html loads on every page: the docs.* redirect shim, the splash
#     theme picker, and the two JSON-LD blocks. Hashed so inline script
#     stays allowed without 'unsafe-inline'. A hash mismatch fails CLOSED
#     (the script silently stops running, not an XSS hole) -- recompute
#     these from index.html's exact bytes if those blocks ever change.
#   style-src 'unsafe-inline' -- React's style={{...}} renders as a style=""
#     attribute (style-src-attr, which falls back to style-src when unset);
#     those values are computed at runtime and cannot be hashed. Style
#     injection is a far smaller attack surface than script injection,
#     which is why this widens style-src but leaves script-src hash-only.
#   style-src/font-src fonts.google* -- index.html's <head> loads Inter and
#     JetBrains Mono from Google Fonts on every page, this one included.
#   connect-src blocks.orangerails.com, stealth.orangerails.com -- the
#     BIP158 block source and filter CDN this widget fetches directly.
#   connect-src the two Supabase project hosts by exact hostname --
#     fzwmnzmtqidumdqjdddz (dev) and lcdicqalreskibdfxkzb (prod), per
#     docs/Stealth-Sync.md and resolveFunctionUrl.test.ts. Listed
#     explicitly rather than a *.supabase.co wildcard: a wildcard would let
#     this page talk to ANY Supabase project, including an attacker's.
#
# KNOWN GAP, not fixed here -- flagged on OR-T0609. OR_STEALTH_INIT accepts
# an optional proxy_base_url (src/stealth/lib/postmessage.ts,
# src/stealth/widget/lib/resolveFunctionUrl.ts) letting a CONSUMING APP
# route the widget's calls through its own server-side proxy at a URL of
# ITS choosing. A static connect-src allowlist cannot cover an arbitrary
# integrator-supplied origin. Whether any current integrator sets this is
# UNVERIFIED here -- no access to search BitBooks/Orange Way/third-party
# codebases from this seat. If one does, that integration breaks under this
# policy until the list is extended or the feature is reworked.
https://connect.orangerails.com/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'wasm-unsafe-eval' 'sha256-9y7fpfrDHCEVYnuFs4LDwMgRPq1W+lKxfyETacdW6uE=' 'sha256-+B3aBgsnvAmS1jEiF/k2Mvc7KHGky9bM4fTmXfNcFWQ=' 'sha256-nGkMeps9emAV22tf8GtAdZcyUis0NrshytYegFxL/bQ=' 'sha256-gaToKRhLWsWHaTNg2cRkV4ug8HgAL//kpKoOYxUy9yc='; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com; img-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' https://blocks.orangerails.com https://stealth.orangerails.com https://fzwmnzmtqidumdqjdddz.supabase.co https://lcdicqalreskibdfxkzb.supabase.co; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; object-src 'none'
